WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:46.160 --> 01:47.800
Now that you've returned to life

01:47.880 --> 01:49.800
and I get to talk to you,

01:49.880 --> 01:52.120
it's like a dream for me.

02:09.639 --> 02:11.680
I also want to work for you, God of War,

02:11.760 --> 02:12.800
and gain experience.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.440
Although

02:14.520 --> 02:16.520
my father always says that I'm delicate

02:16.600 --> 02:18.320
and won't be able
to withstand army training,

02:18.800 --> 02:20.080
I'm really not afraid of tribulations.

02:20.160 --> 02:21.400
Enough.

02:33.880 --> 02:36.240
Lady Chidi?

02:38.720 --> 02:40.320
I'm not feeling well today.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.240
Please leave.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.560
You have just resurrected.

02:45.360 --> 02:47.000
You should rest more.

02:47.080 --> 02:48.840
I was thoughtless.

02:48.920 --> 02:50.000
- Please--
- Get out!

03:12.000 --> 03:13.360
I loved you so much.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.680
Why did you betray me?

03:15.760 --> 03:18.160
Why did you deceive me?

03:18.240 --> 03:20.800
How dare you neglect me?

03:20.880 --> 03:23.080
Why did you cheat on me?

03:23.160 --> 03:25.120
Why?

03:36.840 --> 03:37.920
High God Chidi.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.160
We heard some noise,

03:39.240 --> 03:40.120
so we came to patrol.

03:42.440 --> 03:43.320
High God Chidi.

03:43.400 --> 03:44.640
We heard some noise,

03:44.720 --> 03:45.720
so we came to patrol.

03:53.880 --> 03:54.720
High God Chidi.

04:41.040 --> 04:42.880
Evil God Taisui.

04:44.480 --> 04:46.520
Lady Chidi.

04:46.600 --> 04:49.160
How does it feel to kill your own people?

04:50.440 --> 04:52.880
I've been looking forward to this

04:52.960 --> 04:55.600
since 30,000 years ago.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.720
It's you.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.160
You bewitched Hao!

04:59.640 --> 05:02.480
I just gave him hope.

05:03.160 --> 05:06.200
As for you, Lady Chidi,

05:06.280 --> 05:09.320
for generations, you goddesses risked
your lives to protect the three realms

05:09.400 --> 05:11.200
and stop me from returning.

05:11.280 --> 05:12.880
And then what?

05:12.960 --> 05:14.440
I didn't return.

05:14.520 --> 05:17.240
But it turned out that you're the one
with blood on your hands

05:17.320 --> 05:18.880
and who killed so many people.

05:23.320 --> 05:24.800
For over 100,000 years,

05:25.520 --> 05:27.160
you've always been playing this trick.

05:28.160 --> 05:30.160
These demagogic remarks

05:30.240 --> 05:31.360
are useless to me!

05:31.440 --> 05:32.720
Have you forgotten?

05:32.800 --> 05:34.200
You're wrong.

05:34.280 --> 05:35.800
Lady Chidi.

05:35.880 --> 05:37.680
I'm just here to see you.

05:38.360 --> 05:40.040
I'm already the winner.

05:40.120 --> 05:42.120
I'm not trying
to convince you of anything.

05:42.200 --> 05:44.920
I don't need to do that either.

05:45.520 --> 05:48.080
Goddess Xiyun is resurrected.

05:48.160 --> 05:50.200
And I will also remind Shuiyuntian.

05:50.280 --> 05:52.200
No matter what tricks you play,

05:52.280 --> 05:53.480
you will not succeed!

05:58.640 --> 05:59.760
Lady Chidi.

05:59.840 --> 06:01.920
Don't test people's hearts.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.040
People are silly.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.680
They miss the forest for the trees
and can't see the truth clearly.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.240
Just wait and see.

06:07.320 --> 06:09.640
No one will believe you.

06:09.720 --> 06:12.960
Your immortal body
will be mine sooner or later.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.120
Guards!

06:19.200 --> 06:20.560
I want to see Lord Yunzhong!

06:20.640 --> 06:21.800
If Taisui returns,

06:21.880 --> 06:23.880
the three realms will be in huge trouble!

06:23.960 --> 06:24.920
Guards!

06:25.000 --> 06:26.520
Come here!

06:28.040 --> 06:29.720
Guards!

06:29.800 --> 06:32.640
Her primordial spirit is damaged
and her mind and soul are in chaos.

06:33.720 --> 06:35.240
She just said some crazy words.

06:35.720 --> 06:38.680
But it's strange for her primordial spirit
to be corroded by evil qi.

06:38.760 --> 06:41.600
If it's really related to the Evil God
Taisui, it's not a trivial matter.

06:41.680 --> 06:44.000
We need to gather
the power of all immortals

06:44.080 --> 06:45.320
and be prepared in advance.

06:45.400 --> 06:49.720
After Taisui's immortal body
was destroyed by the first Goddess,

06:50.720 --> 06:53.280
his primordial spirit has been sealed
by generations of goddesses

06:53.360 --> 06:54.960
for hundreds of thousands of years.

06:55.040 --> 06:57.440
The ancient Evil God
is not as powerful anymore.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.080
Besides,

06:59.160 --> 07:00.680
Goddess Xiyun is resurrected.

07:01.240 --> 07:03.080
She will suppress his remaining spirit.

07:03.640 --> 07:06.080
A struggling ancient Evil God

07:06.160 --> 07:08.360
will not be a threat to Shuiyuntian.

07:08.840 --> 07:09.960
Then in your opinion,

07:10.040 --> 07:12.120
what's the real threat to Shuiyuntian?

07:16.520 --> 07:17.720
The most important thing to you

07:17.800 --> 07:19.080
is probably

07:19.720 --> 07:21.400
the war between the two tribes, right?

07:21.480 --> 07:23.200
Of course.

07:24.240 --> 07:25.840
The Moon Tribe is barbaric and brutal

07:25.920 --> 07:27.640
and hate our tribe to the gut.

07:28.320 --> 07:30.680
The truce between us is just temporary.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.960
With the unsealing
of 100,000 enemy soldiers,

07:33.800 --> 07:35.560
the power of Cangyan Sea
has improved greatly.

07:35.640 --> 07:38.040
If another war starts in 100 years,

07:38.640 --> 07:41.040
I wonder how savage they'll be.

07:41.120 --> 07:43.280
But I can see
that Cangyan Sea is resting now.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.720
They have no intention of fighting.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.160
I think starting a war between two tribes

07:47.840 --> 07:49.600
is just your own selfish wish.

07:49.680 --> 07:51.320
All beings are selfish.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.360
Isn't Chidi selfish?

07:56.560 --> 07:58.200
Maybe she suddenly mentioned Taisui

07:59.560 --> 08:02.520
just to lighten
her beloved disciple's crime.

08:03.760 --> 08:05.760
How can you belittle
the former God of War this way?

08:05.840 --> 08:06.800
Enough.

08:08.440 --> 08:10.600
I know you don't want
to share the burden of Shuiyuntian.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.240
I can't force you.

08:23.960 --> 08:26.200
Get ready for your wedding
with the Goddess.

08:27.080 --> 08:29.280
You don't need to worry
about other things.

08:36.919 --> 08:37.799
My lord.

08:37.880 --> 08:39.919
Even if Lady Chidi
has remarkable battle achievements,

08:40.000 --> 08:42.280
if we let evil qi continue to corrode
her primordial spirit,

08:42.360 --> 08:43.960
the consequences will be unimaginable.

08:44.039 --> 08:44.960
At this point,

08:45.040 --> 08:46.840
I'm afraid we can only execute Lady Chidi

08:46.920 --> 08:48.480
to prevent further problems.

08:49.440 --> 08:50.680
But the God of War is righteous.

08:50.760 --> 08:53.600
She sacrificed herself to achieve
a long period of peace for Shuiyuntian.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.520
How can we bear

08:55.600 --> 08:56.920
to execute her?

08:57.480 --> 08:58.640
Please think it over, my lord.

08:59.880 --> 09:01.640
- Please think it over, my lord.
- Please think it over, my lord.

09:02.200 --> 09:05.280
Lady Chidi must not want
to kill her people again.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.640
Lord Yunzhong will execute her

09:06.720 --> 09:08.480
just to free her.

09:10.280 --> 09:11.120
Forget it.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.360
The immortal criminal Ronghao caused this

09:14.440 --> 09:16.160
by going against the heaven's rules.

09:16.240 --> 09:18.240
Even if I can't bear to execute her,

09:18.800 --> 09:20.720
I can't resist the order of the heavens.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.240
Pass my order.

09:27.480 --> 09:29.040
Tomorrow at noon,

09:30.520 --> 09:32.120
execute Lady Chidi

09:32.880 --> 09:34.840
at the Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.240
My lord.

09:44.320 --> 09:45.280
Lord Yunzhong ordered

09:45.360 --> 09:48.040
the former God of War's execution
at the Immortal Slaying Pavilion

09:48.680 --> 09:49.520
tomorrow at noon.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.040
Father.

10:12.680 --> 10:13.520
Father.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.200
What's wrong?

10:16.120 --> 10:16.960
Nothing.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.320
I just came to see you.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.160
Did I wake you up?

10:24.720 --> 10:26.000
It's already late.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.120
Why aren't you resting

10:27.640 --> 10:29.200
and you're dressed so neatly instead?

10:29.800 --> 10:30.680
Where are you going?

10:32.360 --> 10:34.360
Something urgent came up
at Yunzhong Water Pavilion.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.720
I need to deal with it.

10:36.400 --> 10:37.480
Just sleep.

10:37.560 --> 10:38.720
Wait, Father.

10:38.800 --> 10:40.080
I have something to ask you.

10:42.760 --> 10:44.000
We can talk another day.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.000
You said the other day

10:45.720 --> 10:47.240
that you can't always keep me company.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.680
You also said

10:49.640 --> 10:51.920
that if you're gone someday,

10:52.000 --> 10:53.200
I need to take care of Jieli.

10:53.280 --> 10:54.440
What do you mean

10:55.200 --> 10:56.360
by those things?

10:57.160 --> 10:58.440
Nothing.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.520
It was just a reminder.

11:00.600 --> 11:02.000
But it sounds weird to me.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.480
These days,

11:05.200 --> 11:06.760
I couldn't sleep

11:06.840 --> 11:07.800
because I felt uneasy.

11:09.960 --> 11:10.880
Are you

11:12.080 --> 11:13.200
hiding something from me?

11:16.720 --> 11:17.760
Don't think too much.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.160
Danyin.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.920
You're my good daughter.

11:23.800 --> 11:25.600
Be good. Go to sleep.

11:37.680 --> 11:39.040
What are you doing?

11:39.120 --> 11:40.320
Can't you let me sleep?

11:40.400 --> 11:42.760
You'll have plenty of time to sleep
after I beat you to death.

11:42.840 --> 11:43.760
Let me ask you.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.800
Where did my father go tonight?
Do you know?

11:46.560 --> 11:48.360
Why are you asking me that?

11:48.440 --> 11:50.440
Since you came,
my father has been acting weird.

11:50.520 --> 11:51.760
It must be related to you.

11:52.600 --> 11:53.640
Forget it.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.760
He's my father,

11:55.840 --> 11:56.800
not yours.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.080
You don't need to worry about him too.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.200
Greetings, Supreme Liyuan.

12:18.240 --> 12:19.560
Lord Yunzhong ordered me

12:19.640 --> 12:21.080
to interrogate the criminal Ronghao.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.560
You may all leave now.

12:22.640 --> 12:23.560
Well…

12:23.640 --> 12:24.840
We'd better stay here

12:24.920 --> 12:26.080
and follow orders.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.960
The interrogation is confidential.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.440
Leave.

12:30.520 --> 12:31.760
Yes.

12:51.680 --> 12:52.560
My lord.

12:53.400 --> 12:54.400
Ronghao.

12:54.960 --> 12:57.320
I have betrayed my duty for you once.

12:57.960 --> 12:59.520
If I let you go again,

12:59.600 --> 13:01.000
there will be no turning back.

13:01.080 --> 13:02.680
I only have one request.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.360
Give her to me.

13:05.080 --> 13:07.640
When I make sure my daughter
is completely cured of poison,

13:07.720 --> 13:09.080
I will kill her

13:09.160 --> 13:11.400
so that she won't hurt my daughter again.

13:11.480 --> 13:13.440
Dieyi is my trusted subordinate.

13:14.000 --> 13:16.040
During these 30,000 years, without her,

13:16.120 --> 13:17.400
my plan wouldn't be accomplished.

13:17.880 --> 13:19.760
I hope you can let her die quickly

13:19.840 --> 13:20.680
when you kill her.

13:25.040 --> 13:25.880
Ronghao.

13:26.880 --> 13:28.120
Many millennia have passed.

13:28.680 --> 13:31.400
I didn't know you were such a monster.

13:31.480 --> 13:32.720
You're ungrateful

13:32.800 --> 13:34.400
and discard people after using them.

13:37.000 --> 13:39.000
You're sending my master

13:39.080 --> 13:40.480
to the Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

13:41.000 --> 13:43.560
In terms of being ungrateful
and discarding people after using them,

13:43.640 --> 13:45.000
I'm not as good

13:45.080 --> 13:46.640
as the high immortals in Shuiyuntian.

14:11.400 --> 14:12.760
- Danyin.
- Father.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.760
You can't let him go.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.120
Danyin, why are you here?

14:15.200 --> 14:18.080
If I hadn't come, you would've made
a huge mistake for that pest.

14:18.920 --> 14:19.760
Danyin.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.600
Danyin. Listen to me.

14:22.680 --> 14:23.960
Father.

14:24.040 --> 14:25.680
Danyin, go home.

14:26.320 --> 14:28.360
Father, I can't go home.

14:28.960 --> 14:31.440
I'll explain to you later, all right?

14:31.520 --> 14:32.560
- Danyin.
- Come with me now.

14:32.640 --> 14:33.640
- Danyin.
- Father.

14:35.920 --> 14:37.240
Father.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.160
Father.

14:46.280 --> 14:47.160
Father!

15:06.080 --> 15:07.160
Ronghao,

15:07.240 --> 15:09.960
I didn't expect you to be so powerful.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.320
I'm wrong about you indeed.

15:15.440 --> 15:16.720
You can't leave.

15:17.280 --> 15:18.360
Are you going to stop me?

15:18.440 --> 15:19.560
Danyin.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.120
I'm afraid no one can defeat him

15:21.200 --> 15:22.800
except Dongfang Qingcang.

15:22.880 --> 15:24.520
Stay out of this!

15:26.680 --> 15:27.560
Step aside.

15:27.640 --> 15:29.120
If you leave,

15:29.680 --> 15:31.200
my father will be convicted of treason.

15:31.280 --> 15:32.720
He'll be sent to Karma Jail

15:32.800 --> 15:34.360
and Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.080
I'll spare no effort to stop you

15:36.720 --> 15:38.080
from leaving today.

15:42.840 --> 15:44.000
Danyin.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.440
Father, are you all right?

15:48.120 --> 15:51.560
My lord, the former God of War is locked
in the previous Immortal Mansion.

15:51.640 --> 15:53.160
- Kill him.
- Yes.

15:58.880 --> 15:59.960
Father.

16:00.040 --> 16:01.040
Wait for me.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.400
Danyin, stop chasing them.

16:02.480 --> 16:03.720
Stop chasing them!

16:22.800 --> 16:23.640
Stop.

16:25.560 --> 16:26.400
Father.

16:27.040 --> 16:28.280
Put down the sword.

16:28.760 --> 16:29.960
Danyin, leave now.

16:30.520 --> 16:31.520
Go!

16:33.680 --> 16:35.000
Put down the sword.

16:41.240 --> 16:42.280
Let my father go.

16:43.360 --> 16:44.240
No way.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.720
I was ordered to kill him.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.160
Greetings, Pavilion Master.

16:50.240 --> 16:51.400
Jieli.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.440
Jieli.

16:52.520 --> 16:54.120
Jieli, why are you here too?

16:54.200 --> 16:55.400
Go home.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.960
Go home now!

16:57.040 --> 16:57.880
Father,

16:57.960 --> 16:59.960
this pest is in cahoots with them.

17:00.040 --> 17:02.600
Why don't you get it?
Why do you still care about her?

17:02.680 --> 17:04.640
They just poisoned her.

17:06.400 --> 17:08.119
Jieli, come here.

17:09.359 --> 17:10.960
Pick up your sister's sword.

17:11.040 --> 17:12.520
She's poisoned?

17:14.079 --> 17:15.520
Only they can cure her?

17:16.560 --> 17:18.720
So she'll help them to harm us for sure.

17:24.599 --> 17:26.040
Tell me.

17:27.319 --> 17:28.680
Who should be killed?

17:28.760 --> 17:29.680
Kill me.

17:31.280 --> 17:32.320
Kill me.

17:35.920 --> 17:36.760
Pest.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.600
Kill me instead.

17:56.160 --> 17:57.120
Father.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.520
If you kill me,

18:12.960 --> 18:14.120
you will die too.

18:18.320 --> 18:19.640
I've had enough.

18:19.720 --> 18:21.040
Stop trying to control me.

18:58.400 --> 18:59.520
Master.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.200
I'm late.

19:07.400 --> 19:12.360
ZHILAN PAVILION

19:17.160 --> 19:18.000
Danyin.

19:19.520 --> 19:21.120
Take Jieli inside

19:21.680 --> 19:23.240
and pretend you didn't come out tonight.

19:23.800 --> 19:24.880
No matter who asks you,

19:24.960 --> 19:26.600
just pretend you don't know anything.

19:26.680 --> 19:27.760
Got it?

19:28.240 --> 19:29.440
Go in now.

19:30.600 --> 19:31.840
Father, what about you?

19:32.680 --> 19:34.680
I'll turn myself in to Lord Yunzhong.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.280
I'll go with you.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.120
Danyin.

19:44.480 --> 19:46.160
I can't protect you anymore.

19:47.400 --> 19:48.240
Jieli.

19:54.520 --> 19:55.520
My daughters.

19:55.600 --> 19:58.040
I've been repenting
for thousands of years to make up

19:58.120 --> 19:59.560
for what happened back then.

20:00.880 --> 20:03.040
But even when your mother died,

20:04.000 --> 20:05.800
I couldn't see her for the last time.

20:07.680 --> 20:08.520
Danyin.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.960
You've been spoiled since you were little.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.080
But overnight,

20:12.160 --> 20:14.520
you'll become the daughter
of an immortal criminal and traitor

20:14.600 --> 20:15.920
who will be despised by everyone.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.640
Jieli.

20:19.200 --> 20:21.480
I haven't been with you
since you were little.

20:21.560 --> 20:22.640
You have suffered a lot.

20:22.720 --> 20:24.480
You haven't even got the antidote yet.

20:27.960 --> 20:29.240
I'm sorry.

20:31.320 --> 20:33.640
I can't even protect my own daughters.

20:33.720 --> 20:35.680
My life is wasted.

20:38.360 --> 20:39.400
Danyin.

20:39.480 --> 20:40.560
Jieli.

20:42.640 --> 20:44.120
When I'm gone,

20:44.920 --> 20:47.360
you two should be united

20:47.440 --> 20:49.120
and support each other.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.640
Understand?

20:54.920 --> 20:55.800
Do you understand?

20:56.720 --> 20:58.520
Yes.

20:58.600 --> 20:59.440
Father.

21:00.280 --> 21:01.560
Father.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.920
Go in.

21:05.000 --> 21:05.960
No.

21:06.440 --> 21:08.160
Father, I want to be with you.

21:08.240 --> 21:10.480
Regardless if it's
Immortal Slaying Pavilion or Karma Jail,

21:10.560 --> 21:11.880
I'll go with you.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.520
Go in. Someone is coming.

21:27.600 --> 21:29.440
- Go inside.
- No, I'm not leaving.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.080
- Go in.
- I'm not leaving.

21:32.160 --> 21:33.840
- Hurry.
- I'm not leaving.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.120
I'll take her inside.

22:16.920 --> 22:17.760
Father.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.440
Stop going after him.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.440
Didn't he already tell you?

22:21.520 --> 22:22.600
He went to turn himself in.

22:23.560 --> 22:24.840
Did you knock me out?

22:26.920 --> 22:28.360
Your father wanted you to leave.

22:29.000 --> 22:31.000
He treated me so well these days.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.920
I was just doing him a favor.

22:33.600 --> 22:35.080
You just left him like that?

22:35.720 --> 22:37.760
How can you speak
like it's none of your business?

22:37.840 --> 22:39.040
He is also your father.

22:42.800 --> 22:44.000
It's all your fault.

22:44.600 --> 22:45.760
You pest.

22:45.840 --> 22:47.040
You're a pest.

22:47.120 --> 22:48.000
Everything was fine

22:48.080 --> 22:49.120
without you.

22:49.680 --> 22:53.080
You showed up
and completely ruined my life.

22:54.520 --> 22:55.600
I'm talking to you.

22:56.080 --> 22:58.560
Let me ask you. Why did you pretend
to save me at Karma Jail?

22:58.640 --> 23:00.240
Didn't I tell you?

23:01.160 --> 23:03.440
All I want is to survive.

23:04.000 --> 23:04.840
Nothing else.

23:05.640 --> 23:07.120
I acknowledged our relationship

23:07.200 --> 23:08.680
just to survive.

23:08.760 --> 23:10.240
But since you killed that butterfly demon,

23:10.800 --> 23:11.920
you won't be able to live, right?

23:12.520 --> 23:13.360
Yes.

23:14.520 --> 23:15.600
Because

23:16.160 --> 23:17.440
I don't feel like living anymore.

23:18.800 --> 23:19.760
Why?

23:20.360 --> 23:21.360
You like Changheng, right?

23:22.920 --> 23:25.440
Will you lie to him and betray him?

23:25.520 --> 23:26.520
Of course not.

23:26.600 --> 23:27.560
Never.

23:29.080 --> 23:30.200
But I will.

23:30.760 --> 23:31.760
In order to survive,

23:32.360 --> 23:34.320
I will betray my best friends

23:34.400 --> 23:36.320
and lie to the person I love most.

23:38.160 --> 23:40.240
I didn't kill Dieyi to save you.

23:40.320 --> 23:42.080
I just hate her so much.

23:43.120 --> 23:45.840
She controlled me and made me do
a lot of things that I didn't want to.

23:46.560 --> 23:48.680
I've hurt people
I didn't want to hurt the most.

23:49.800 --> 23:51.480
I should have killed her

23:51.560 --> 23:52.760
a long time ago.

23:52.840 --> 23:54.360
Since you've killed her

23:55.440 --> 23:56.680
and got rid of her control,

23:58.560 --> 23:59.720
the people you care about

24:00.720 --> 24:01.840
will also forgive you.

24:04.000 --> 24:04.840
No.

24:05.840 --> 24:06.760
Even if they will,

24:07.480 --> 24:09.040
I don't want them to forgive me.

24:09.120 --> 24:10.600
What for?

24:11.080 --> 24:12.320
I'm such a jerk.

24:12.800 --> 24:14.520
Didn't you just say

24:14.600 --> 24:15.640
that I am

24:15.720 --> 24:17.280
a pest?

24:18.720 --> 24:19.920
Without me,

24:20.920 --> 24:22.640
everyone can live a good life.

24:24.880 --> 24:26.040
But your father

24:26.600 --> 24:27.480
is such a fool.

24:28.600 --> 24:30.440
I just pretended to be a good girl

24:31.200 --> 24:32.960
and he was so nice to me.

24:33.920 --> 24:35.280
He did whatever I wanted.

24:37.560 --> 24:39.120
But receiving love based on a trick

24:40.000 --> 24:41.160
is meaningless.

24:45.200 --> 24:46.480
I don't want to lie anymore.

25:03.720 --> 25:04.600
What's wrong with you?

25:12.880 --> 25:14.480
There is good medicine in Wuxian Clan

25:14.560 --> 25:15.560
called Memory Recollection Pill.

25:15.640 --> 25:16.840
It can help people regain memories.

25:17.960 --> 25:19.080
The Memory Recollection Pill

25:19.160 --> 25:20.240
can help the old

25:20.320 --> 25:22.120
and confused regain their memories.

25:22.200 --> 25:24.560
It's not suitable for Fairy Orchid.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.720
Then…

25:31.760 --> 25:35.200
If I take her to the places
we went to before

25:35.880 --> 25:37.880
and tell her everything that happened,

25:37.960 --> 25:39.920
can that stimulate her
to remember something?

25:40.000 --> 25:43.200
But haven't you already done
these things a few days ago?

25:43.960 --> 25:45.400
They didn't work at all.

25:47.720 --> 25:48.560
Then…

25:50.240 --> 25:52.720
The Spiritual Treasures Pavilion has
a black jade bed that helps create dreams.

25:53.240 --> 25:55.920
You can dream about the most beautiful
moments in your life while sleeping on it.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.360
If I move the bed here--

25:57.440 --> 25:59.600
She needs to remember them first
in order to dream them.

25:59.680 --> 26:01.000
The order is wrong.

26:04.640 --> 26:07.200
Why do you always put a damper
on my plans?

26:09.480 --> 26:10.320
No.

26:10.800 --> 26:11.800
I don't dare to do that.

26:30.520 --> 26:31.960
I have something to tell you.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.200
I already know

26:35.720 --> 26:37.920
that you had a relationship with Orchid.

26:38.000 --> 26:39.800
And you two almost got married.

26:43.920 --> 26:44.760
Do you

26:45.600 --> 26:46.600
remember it now?

26:49.440 --> 26:51.080
Changheng already told me everything

26:51.160 --> 26:52.200
that happened before.

26:53.560 --> 26:55.240
I'm only here to tell you

26:55.320 --> 26:57.200
that I'm not Orchid.

26:57.760 --> 27:00.400
And Orchid will never return.

27:00.480 --> 27:01.640
You are Orchid.

27:02.360 --> 27:03.400
She will come back.

27:03.480 --> 27:04.720
I'm not.

27:06.040 --> 27:06.880
Back then,

27:07.480 --> 27:09.200
Arbiter made me look
like a fake orchid plant

27:09.800 --> 27:12.200
in order to hide

27:12.280 --> 27:14.320
my Xilan Plant identity.

27:14.920 --> 27:15.840
And Orchid

27:15.920 --> 27:18.000
is only a weak memory attached

27:18.080 --> 27:19.680
to this illusion.

27:20.240 --> 27:22.800
Now, the illusion has been removed,

27:22.880 --> 27:25.040
so Orchid disappeared with the memory

27:25.120 --> 27:26.520
and will never come back.

27:26.600 --> 27:28.080
The one in front of you

27:28.560 --> 27:30.120
is just Goddess Xiyun.

27:34.480 --> 27:35.440
You're wrong.

27:37.280 --> 27:38.200
She's still here.

27:38.280 --> 27:39.640
She's gone.

27:40.120 --> 27:41.440
I have evidence.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.160
What evidence?

27:43.240 --> 27:45.400
Orchid likes flowers and grass.

27:45.480 --> 27:46.840
You also like them.

27:47.600 --> 27:49.200
She lives in the Arbiter Hall.

27:49.280 --> 27:50.760
You also live in the Arbiter Hall.

27:50.840 --> 27:52.040
Orchid…

27:53.560 --> 27:55.920
She likes to wear clothes in light colors.

27:56.000 --> 27:58.560
You also like these colors.

28:01.400 --> 28:02.480
You must be her.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.440
She must still be here.

28:05.600 --> 28:06.600
In three days,

28:07.240 --> 28:08.800
I will marry Changheng.

28:39.360 --> 28:41.400
Don't play dead. Get up.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.280
Danyin.

28:44.120 --> 28:45.840
It will be useless even if we get there.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.480
Why is it useless?

28:49.360 --> 28:51.680
The Goddess of Xishan
has the strongest healing magic.

28:51.760 --> 28:53.080
And she can resurrect dead things.

28:54.080 --> 28:55.120
She can surely cure you.

28:55.680 --> 28:56.640
Come on.

28:57.840 --> 28:59.120
Get up.

29:07.600 --> 29:08.760
Leave me alone.

29:10.400 --> 29:11.760
Go by yourself.

29:14.480 --> 29:15.720
Leave me alone.

29:16.440 --> 29:17.280
I'll carry you.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.640
Come on.

29:23.560 --> 29:24.720
What are you waiting for?

29:24.800 --> 29:25.720
Come up.

29:41.840 --> 29:45.560
ARBITER HALL

29:45.640 --> 29:50.000
ARBITER HALL

29:59.000 --> 30:02.120
ARBITER HALL

30:06.680 --> 30:07.560
Fairy Danyin.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.680
I want to see the Goddess.

30:09.440 --> 30:10.360
Immediately.

30:19.120 --> 30:19.960
Come with me.

30:23.400 --> 30:27.200
ARBITER HALL

30:36.240 --> 30:37.400
The Goddess wants you to go upstairs.

30:41.280 --> 30:42.120
Let's go.

31:20.200 --> 31:22.120
I've already forgotten the past.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.800
I don't remember

31:24.880 --> 31:26.040
our friendship

31:26.120 --> 31:27.560
and your deception anymore.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.360
You can stay.

31:32.120 --> 31:33.320
From now on,

31:33.800 --> 31:35.400
I will cure you and extend your life.

31:38.080 --> 31:39.320
Thank you, Goddess.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.280
Jieli.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.520
Thank you, Goddess.

31:48.680 --> 31:49.960
By the way,

31:50.040 --> 31:50.960
Goddess,

31:52.320 --> 31:53.160
Lord Changheng.

31:55.680 --> 31:57.120
I have to tell you something

31:57.200 --> 31:58.040
very important.

32:00.000 --> 32:01.280
Ronghao escaped from Karma Jail.

32:01.360 --> 32:02.520
When did that happen?

32:02.600 --> 32:03.760
Tonight.

32:04.680 --> 32:05.600
Also,

32:06.240 --> 32:07.800
I heard

32:07.880 --> 32:10.200
that the former God of War
went crazy for some reason.

32:11.760 --> 32:12.600
She said

32:13.960 --> 32:15.520
that she saw the Evil God Taisui.

32:18.200 --> 32:19.200
Fairy Danyin.

32:20.200 --> 32:21.840
Please tell me

32:21.920 --> 32:23.080
everything you heard and saw.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.160
Yes.

32:28.720 --> 32:30.200
Before we met,

32:30.280 --> 32:31.800
I thought she was Orchid.

32:33.120 --> 32:34.280
But when I saw her,

32:35.040 --> 32:37.200
I couldn't help keeping my voice down

32:37.280 --> 32:38.400
and dared not make trouble.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.680
When she looked at me,

32:41.960 --> 32:43.360
my heart beat faster.

32:44.400 --> 32:45.240
Yes.

32:46.200 --> 32:47.640
They look the same,

32:48.600 --> 32:50.720
but there is no sign of Orchid in her.

32:52.560 --> 32:54.200
She is really

32:54.960 --> 32:57.440
the Goddess of Xishan
who protects the three realms now.

32:58.920 --> 33:00.960
She's a perfect match

33:02.680 --> 33:03.760
for Lord Changheng.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.440
You sound jealous.

33:07.520 --> 33:09.080
Are you still not over

33:09.760 --> 33:10.800
your Lord Changheng?

33:12.360 --> 33:13.800
What do you know?

33:15.720 --> 33:17.520
When I told everyone
at Yunzhong Water Pavilion

33:18.720 --> 33:21.280
that Orchid is the Goddess of Xishan,

33:23.560 --> 33:24.800
I already let him go.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.040
You are the Goddess's guests.

33:29.920 --> 33:31.520
Let me arrange a place for you.

33:31.600 --> 33:33.080
- Sure.
- There's no need.

33:33.800 --> 33:35.400
I'm very familiar with Arbiter Hall.

33:35.480 --> 33:36.360
I know where to stay.

33:36.440 --> 33:37.680
Have you had a meal?

33:38.200 --> 33:39.440
I'll prepare some food for you.

33:40.120 --> 33:40.960
We're not hungry.

33:43.000 --> 33:44.360
Ms. Jieli.

33:46.160 --> 33:47.400
How have you been doing lately?

33:48.800 --> 33:49.640
I'm doing great.

33:50.640 --> 33:51.920
Thank you for your concern.

34:04.680 --> 34:06.200
Why are you so cold to him?

34:07.840 --> 34:09.880
You two were a couple, right?

34:11.960 --> 34:13.159
It's all in the past now.

34:13.239 --> 34:14.880
Why are you acting this way?

34:16.199 --> 34:17.520
The person I like

34:18.320 --> 34:19.880
doesn't like me.

34:21.280 --> 34:22.679
But the person you like

34:23.480 --> 34:24.639
loves you.

34:25.199 --> 34:26.360
He shouldn't love me.

34:27.719 --> 34:29.199
In my opinion,

34:29.960 --> 34:31.600
Shangque is the purest,

34:32.400 --> 34:33.760
brightest,

34:33.840 --> 34:35.159
and gentlest person in the world.

34:36.360 --> 34:37.320
I don't deserve

34:37.840 --> 34:38.760
such a person.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.280
Look at you.

34:40.880 --> 34:42.080
You're my younger sister.

34:42.159 --> 34:43.400
You deserve to be with anyone.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.440
Forget the little black dragon,

34:46.000 --> 34:47.360
you deserve the King of Heaven.

34:48.840 --> 34:50.120
You don't understand.

34:50.199 --> 34:51.199
You can have

34:51.280 --> 34:52.719
the trust

34:53.199 --> 34:54.400
and eternal love of someone,

34:55.159 --> 34:57.280
but a person like me can't.

34:59.120 --> 35:00.720
Even if I gained it by chance,

35:01.720 --> 35:03.360
I would lose it eventually.

35:04.920 --> 35:07.440
Then I'd rather not expect anything
in the beginning.

35:09.760 --> 35:10.760
What a coward.

35:13.160 --> 35:14.000
Let's go.

35:18.640 --> 35:19.720
This is a love candle.

35:21.200 --> 35:22.840
They say that its fragrance

35:27.240 --> 35:28.200
can make people…

35:29.280 --> 35:30.120
What?

35:34.880 --> 35:35.880
Remember a past love

35:36.720 --> 35:37.920
and reunite.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.320
You want to use it on Jieli?

35:45.080 --> 35:46.080
How ridiculous.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.840
You're the Moon Supreme's chief guard.

35:50.440 --> 35:53.160
How can you play a trick
used in an imperial harem?

35:54.440 --> 35:55.360
Are you crazy?

35:58.120 --> 35:59.400
I might be crazy.

36:00.520 --> 36:01.840
But as long as she can return…

36:01.920 --> 36:02.840
She won't.

36:10.480 --> 36:12.880
She's no longer the Jieli you knew before.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.360
No.

36:15.400 --> 36:17.240
She is the Jieli I knew back then.

36:17.880 --> 36:20.960
She was a spy for Haishi
from the beginning.

36:21.920 --> 36:24.280
Everything you saw was a pretense.

36:27.160 --> 36:28.320
Throw away the candle.

36:29.880 --> 36:31.160
No, my lord.

36:32.680 --> 36:34.160
Let me try.

36:34.240 --> 36:36.280
Can't you face reality?

36:36.360 --> 36:38.680
But you're also the same, aren't you?

36:42.120 --> 36:44.640
Don't you think
that the Goddess is Orchid too?

36:51.000 --> 36:52.360
I shouldn't have said that.

37:12.560 --> 37:13.440
Have a drink with me.

37:51.880 --> 37:53.600
High God Chidi's warning is true.

37:53.680 --> 37:54.720
Taisui has escaped.

37:55.360 --> 37:56.320
It seems like

37:56.400 --> 37:57.720
on the day I died in Xuanxu Realm,

37:57.800 --> 37:59.400
when my primordial spirit was destroyed

37:59.480 --> 38:01.760
and my power was at its weakest,

38:01.840 --> 38:03.520
Taisui took the chance to break the seal.

38:03.600 --> 38:05.640
But he has no immortal body,
only a strand of soul.

38:05.720 --> 38:06.560
He can't do evil.

38:06.640 --> 38:07.520
We still have time.

38:08.600 --> 38:09.480
No.

38:09.560 --> 38:10.560
Without an actual body,

38:11.160 --> 38:13.600
he can appear
in every corner of this world,

38:13.680 --> 38:15.080
including anyone's mind,

38:15.160 --> 38:16.720
and bewitch those who have delusions

38:17.320 --> 38:18.440
and use them

38:18.520 --> 38:19.680
to do evil for him.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.400
For peace in the three realms,

38:21.480 --> 38:22.640
this time,

38:22.720 --> 38:24.360
we must destroy him completely.

38:44.920 --> 38:47.240
Didn't you say that you love Orchid?

38:49.080 --> 38:52.080
Then why did you agree
to marry the Goddess?

38:58.120 --> 39:00.240
Whether she remembers the past or not,

39:02.240 --> 39:03.760
she is still my betrothed.

39:04.800 --> 39:05.840
This is what was predicted.

39:06.360 --> 39:08.480
Didn't you see it
in the Tianji Mirror too?

39:11.760 --> 39:12.600
Lord Changheng.

39:53.800 --> 39:54.680
Don't see me off.

39:55.720 --> 39:57.160
Just stay here

39:57.240 --> 39:58.560
to heal and recuperate.

39:58.640 --> 39:59.920
Don't go anywhere.

40:01.800 --> 40:02.880
I'll go back to Shuiyuntian

40:04.360 --> 40:05.760
to ask for information about Father.

40:07.720 --> 40:09.440
If you have any news,

40:11.440 --> 40:12.680
keep me updated too.

40:38.400 --> 40:39.440
Lord Changheng.

40:48.040 --> 40:48.960
Are we

40:49.040 --> 40:50.880
friends now?

40:51.880 --> 40:53.960
Fairy Danyin, you are my closest friend.

40:54.040 --> 40:54.960
Then

40:55.560 --> 40:56.840
let me ask you.

40:58.400 --> 40:59.520
Do you really want

41:00.080 --> 41:01.760
to marry the Goddess?

41:04.120 --> 41:04.960
Is this

41:05.680 --> 41:07.360
really what you want?

41:10.320 --> 41:11.320
In the past,

41:11.880 --> 41:13.240
I've been deceiving myself.

41:14.360 --> 41:16.680
I knew that you love someone else,

41:17.240 --> 41:18.600
but I still hoped

41:18.680 --> 41:20.160
that a miracle would happen one day

41:21.320 --> 41:22.240
and you could

41:23.320 --> 41:24.200
turn around,

41:25.280 --> 41:26.480
see me,

41:27.040 --> 41:27.920
like me,

41:28.880 --> 41:29.920
and even fall for me.

41:30.000 --> 41:33.120
That was why I wouldn't tell you
what I saw in the Tianji Mirror.

41:33.200 --> 41:34.600
I hid it from everyone

41:35.720 --> 41:36.920
and myself.

41:38.520 --> 41:39.600
But later on, I realized

41:40.560 --> 41:42.120
that those were my delusions.

41:43.320 --> 41:44.200
I was greedy.

41:45.520 --> 41:46.800
I was possessive.

41:48.800 --> 41:49.720
If it's not mine,

41:51.320 --> 41:52.480
it won't be mine.

41:53.840 --> 41:54.680
Changheng.

41:55.600 --> 41:57.560
I don't want you
to be controlled by delusions too.

41:58.720 --> 41:59.920
- The Goddess--
- Danyin.

42:00.440 --> 42:01.800
Stop.

42:04.880 --> 42:06.200
This is my destiny.

42:07.800 --> 42:09.160
No matter how hard it is to swallow

42:09.640 --> 42:10.800
this bitter fruit of fate,

42:11.760 --> 42:12.960
I will do it

42:14.040 --> 42:14.960
for her.

42:25.080 --> 42:26.480
It's scorching hot.

42:27.680 --> 42:29.200
Let's take a rest here.

42:29.800 --> 42:30.760
- All right.
- All right.

42:30.840 --> 42:32.000
Let's rest for a while.
